      108,
      112,
      116,
      120,
      124,
      128
    ],
    "constraintsCN": [
      "所有 spacing（padding/margin/gap）取值必须在 allowedValues 内",
      "allowedValues 等价于：4 或 8 的倍数（4~128），例外 0 与 2",
      "token.value 必须与 allowedValues 一致；场景 token 通过 ref 引用 global token"
    ],
    "constraintsEN": [
      "All spacing values must be one of allowedValues",
      "allowedValues equivalent to: multiples of 4 or 8 from 4 to 128, with 0 and 2 as exceptions",
      "Each token.value must be in allowedValues; scene tokens reference global tokens via ref"
    ]
